<header><p class="enc-kicker">Person</p><h1 class="enc-title">Isaias Afwerki</h1><p class="enc-meta"><span class="dates">b. <a href="/years/1946">1946</a></span> · <a href="/centuries/20th-century">20th century</a></p></header>
<div class="enc-body"><p class="enc-desc">Isaias Afwerki is an Eritrean politician who led the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/eritrean-peoples-liberation-front">Eritrean People's Liberation Front</a> in the war of independence against <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/ethiopia">Ethiopia</a> and has been president of <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/eritrea">Eritrea</a> since independence in 1993. His <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/peoples-front-for-democracy-and-justice">People's Front for Democracy and Justice</a> is the only legal party, the constitution of 1997 has never been implemented and no national elections have been held. His government is known for indefinite national service and the border war with Ethiopia of 1998–2000.</p><figure class="enc-fig"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/isaias-afwerki.jpg" alt="Isaias Afwerki" width="330" height="462" fetchpriority="high"><figcaption>Image: Quirinale (Francesco Ammendola and Paolo Giandotti) · Attribution · <a href="https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Isaias_Afwerki_2024_(cropped).jpg" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Wikimedia Commons</a></figcaption></figure></div>
<section class="enc-quotes"><h2 class="enc-section-title">Across the Institute</h2><ul><li><blockquote>In a UN-monitored referendum in April 1993, 99.8 per cent voted for independence, which was declared on 24 May 1993, with EPLF leader <b>Isaias Afwerki</b> as president.</blockquote><a href="/state/state-of-eritrea">State of Eritrea</a></li></ul></section>
<section class="enc-where enc-born"><h2 class="enc-section-title">Born and died</h2><p class="enc-born-p">Born in <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/asmara">Asmara</a>, in what is now <a href="/countries/eritrea">Eritrea</a>. <span class="enc-born-src">Places as Wikidata records them.</span></p><figure class="st-locator enc-loc"><a href="/atlas?at=15.33,38.92&amp;year=1981" aria-label="Asmara on the atlas"><svg class="map map-loc" viewBox="5613 1593 900 540" role="img" aria-label="Map: the birthplace of Isaias Afwerki"><image href="/maps/world.svg" x="0" y="0" width="10000" height="4393"/><path class="map-dot-halo" d="M6063 1863h0"/><path class="map-dot-me" d="M6063 1863h0"/></svg></a><figcaption>The dot marks the birthplace. <a href="/atlas?at=15.33,38.92&amp;year=1981">What was here in 1981? &rarr;</a></figcaption></figure></section>
